OL,3,GNEWSATwo men deny murder of man, 20,
OL,4,Astabbed to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have appeared in court and
OL,7,Fpleaded not guilty to murdering a
OL,8,F20-year-old man in Staffordshire.
OL,10,FJamie Evans, from Stone, died in
OL,11,Fhospital after being injured from a
OL,12,Fsingle stab wound in
OL,13,FNewcastle-under-Lyme on 4 September,
OL,14,FStaffordshire Police said.
OL,16,FCorey Hughes, 20, and Connor Cartlidge,
OL,17,F23, both from Newcastle-under-Lyme,
OL,18,Fappeared at Stoke-on-Trent crown Court
OL,19,Fearlier and pleaded not guilty.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
